<description><![CDATA[<div><b>全是赛博牛马</b><br/><br/>OpenDesign Go 这波是真舍得给。<i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png')"><b>🤣</b></i><br/><br/>DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Eco，首月只要 &#036;8，却给了等价 &#036;220 的月度使用额度。<br/><br/>于是乎，我给 <a href="http://monk.party/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">monk.party</a> 一口气接入了 5 个基础订阅账号。<br/><br/>结果发现，这玩意儿是真耐造啊！<br/><br/>上一轮额度还没用到一半，今早又重置了。<i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png')"><b>🤡</b></i><br/><br/>这下好了，赛博牛马的饲料根本吃不完。<br/><br/>大家放开蹬，别替我省 Token。 <i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F84.png')"><b>🏄</b></i><br/><br/>另外，最近还干了一件很有意思的事。<br/><br/>我把整个 Monk API 服务的日常运营交给 Agent 了。<br/><br/>更好玩的是，我把这些 Agent 的工作状态全部可视化，搞了一个「AI 员工办公室」。<br/><br/>以前是我盯着服务器、看日志、处理问题，现在是一群赛博牛马在办公室里各司其职，我偶尔进去视察一下。<i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png')"><b>🤣</b></i><br/><br/>这种感觉真的很奇妙，自己做的产品，慢慢开始自己照顾自己了。<br/><br/>大家有空也可以来我的 AI 办公室逛逛，看看什么叫 AI Native 的系统。<br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9189.png')"><b>👉</b></i> <a href="https://universe.monk.party/office" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://universe.monk.party/office</a><br/><br/>人类负责喝咖啡，Agent 负责上班。<br/><br/>小声过日子，大声用 Token。<i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8C9A.png')"><b>🌚</b></i></div><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9988.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F84.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9189.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8C9A.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/lnXxE8fYNQUShNzBuWLSwOSzF9rraM7lTpg4EuBZq7zB3CSvsKQI05y0bEgRbij8OG6xpifMAuE7wHxS2VLAzETLRRW_-wOKYESDcaCYFCv707TNofyum0CWXJPVGTOdnwhNkNzQtE4XIUleIL_xs2PX7JfKWD8_3hl_zMVt-g5QqrgYF2tV3ctxUpuiDCF8A8g_x-OWCNEPHKaisOPPZCv6wflaIMLnmuXoyywseAPxgvcEFSeEqH93EG5wF9m6ni_wRp8RtaP1x0E8uBBlDHgL-FUTg6GJ61PvAia_IQYAdV3dyN8u-ik8Qy8a8LLPTHpm8Z_v8G_xRKAgf6cFJg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><blockquote style='border-left:3px solid #ccc;padding-left:8px;'><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/lnXxE8fYNQUShNzBuWLSwOSzF9rraM7lTpg4EuBZq7zB3CSvsKQI05y0bEgRbij8OG6xpifMAuE7wHxS2VLAzETLRRW_-wOKYESDcaCYFCv707TNofyum0CWXJPVGTOdnwhNkNzQtE4XIUleIL_xs2PX7JfKWD8_3hl_zMVt-g5QqrgYF2tV3ctxUpuiDCF8A8g_x-OWCNEPHKaisOPPZCv6wflaIMLnmuXoyywseAPxgvcEFSeEqH93EG5wF9m6ni_wRp8RtaP1x0E8uBBlDHgL-FUTg6GJ61PvAia_IQYAdV3dyN8u-ik8Qy8a8LLPTHpm8Z_v8G_xRKAgf6cFJg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"><br><b><a href="https://universe.monk.party/office">AI 办公室 · monk 宇宙</a></b><br><small>monk 宇宙</small><br>每个服务都是一位 AI 员工，此刻谁在忙什么，实时看得到。</blockquote></p>]]></description>
